[00:30.840]Finally the hills are without eyes
{"终于群山不再凝视"}
[00:33.990]They are tired of painting
{"它们厌倦了涂抹"}
[00:37.370]A dead man's face red
{"将死者的面容染红"}
[00:39.760]With their own blood
{"用自己流淌的鲜血"}
[00:43.740]We used to love
{"我们曾深爱彼此"}
[00:46.170]Having so much to lose
{"背负着沉痛代价"}
[00:49.180]Blink your eyes just once
{"只需轻轻眨动眼睛"}
[00:52.470]And see everything in ruins
{"便目睹万物成废墟"}
[01:00.319]Did you ever hear what I told you?
{"可曾听见我的诉说？"}
[01:03.259]Did you ever read what I wrote you?
{"可曾读过我的字句？"}
[01:06.480]Did you ever listen to what we played?
{"可曾聆听我们的乐章？"}
[01:10.358]Did you ever let in what the world said?
{"可曾接纳世人的呐喊？"}
[01:12.980]Did we get this far just to feel your hate?
{"跋涉至此只为感受你的恨意？"}
[01:16.920]Did we play to become only pawns in the game?
{"倾尽演出却沦为棋局卒子？"}
[01:20.328]How blind can you be? Don t you see?
{"还要盲目到何时？难道你看不见"}
[01:23.290]You chose the long road, but we'll be waiting
{"你选择漫漫长路　我们始终守候"}
[01:26.519]Bye bye beautiful!
{"再见 美丽的你！"}
[01:30.090]Bye bye beautiful!
{"再见 美丽的你！"}
[01:33.849]
[01:47.780]Jacob's ghost for the girl in white
{"白衣少女邂逅雅各亡魂"}
[01:51.578]Blindfold for the blind
{"盲者戴上自缚的眼罩"}
[01:54.610]Dead siblings walking the dying earth
{"逝去的同胞行走在垂死大地"}
[02:00.290]Noose around a choking heart
{"绞索缠绕窒息的心脏"}
[02:05.709]Eternity torn apart
{"永恒被撕成碎片"}
[02:07.950]Slow toll now the funeral bells
{"丧钟此刻缓缓敲响"}
[02:13.229]"I need to die to feel alive"
{"唯有死亡让我感知存在"}
[02:17.099]Did you ever hear what I told you?
{"你可曾听见我对你说的话？"}
[02:20.129]Did you ever read what I wrote you?
{"你可曾读过我写给你的信？"}
[02:23.379]Did you ever listen to what we played?
{"你可曾聆听我们演奏的乐章？"}
[02:26.899]Did you ever let in what the world said?
{"你可曾接纳这世界的箴言？"}
[02:29.859]Did we get this far just to feel your hate?
{"我们走到今天只为感受你的恨意？"}
[02:33.299]Did we play to become only pawns in the game?
{"我们演奏难道只为成为棋局卒子？"}
[02:36.929]How blind can you be? Don t you see?
{"你还要盲目到何时？难道看不见？"}
[02:40.970]You choose the long road, but we'll be waiting
{"你选择漫长路途　但我们仍会守候"}
[02:43.720]Bye bye beautiful!
{"再见 美丽的你！"}
[02:46.940]Bye bye beautiful!
{"再见 美丽的你！"}
[02:50.110]Bye bye beautiful!
{"再见 美丽的你！"}
[02:53.389]Bye bye beautiful!
{"再见 美丽的你！"}
[02:56.360]
[03:02.176]It’s not the tree that forsakes the flower,
{"并非大树抛弃了花朵"}
[03:05.057]But the flower that forsakes the tree
{"而是花朵舍弃了大树"}
[03:07.757]Someday I'll learn to love these scars
{"终有一天我会学会爱上这些伤痕"}
[03:11.646]Still fresh from the red-hot blade of your words
{"它们仍新鲜　来自你言语的灼热利刃"}
[03:18.826]How blind can you be? Don t you see?
{"你还要盲目到何时？难道看不见？"}
[03:20.407]How blind can you be? Don t you see?
{"你还要盲目到何时？难道看不见？"}
[03:23.697]How blind can you be? Don t you see?
{"你还要盲目到何时？难道看不见？"}
[03:24.336]That the gambler lost all he does not have
{"赌徒输掉的正是他从未拥有之物"}
[03:31.176]Did you ever hear what I told you?
{"你可曾听见我对你说的话？"}
[03:34.408]Did you ever read what I wrote you?
{"你可曾读过我写给你的信？"}
[03:38.047]Did you ever listen to what we played?
{"你可曾聆听我们演奏的乐章？"}
[03:41.717]Did you ever let in what the world said?
{"你可曾接纳这世界的箴言？"}
[03:44.456]Did we get this far just to feel your hate?
{"我们走到今天只为感受你的恨意？"}
[03:47.896]Did we play to become only pawns in the game?
{"我们奋力拼搏难道只为沦为棋局中的卒子？"}
[03:51.266]How blind can you be? Don t you see?
{"你究竟能盲目到何种程度？难道视而不见？"}
[03:54.257]You choose the long road, but we ll be waiting
{"你选择了漫漫长路，但我们终将守候"}
